{"id":"712165bc47a6ac48","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-divrem-function.md","title":"Total Quotient and Remainder","display":"df-divrem-function — Total Quotient and Remainder","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-divrem-function","aliases":["57-df-divrem-function"],"display":"df-divrem-function — Total Quotient and Remainder","depends_on":["[[57-df-addition-function]]","[[57-df-multiplication-function]]","[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-divrem-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-divrem-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-divrem-function — Total Quotient and Remainder"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" href=\"?note=7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" title=\"57-df-addition-function\">57-df-addition-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c6df01b45cb8cc59\" href=\"?note=c6df01b45cb8cc59\" title=\"57-df-multiplication-function\">57-df-multiplication-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{PR}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{PR}_2\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" href=\"?note=7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" title=\"57-df-addition-function\">57-df-addition-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c6df01b45cb8cc59\" href=\"?note=c6df01b45cb8cc59\" title=\"57-df-multiplication-function\">57-df-multiplication-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dotminus\">\\(\\dotminus\\)</span> 是下式定义的截断减法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\dotminus c\\coloneqq\\max\\{a-c,0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\dotminus c\\coloneqq\\max\\{a-c,0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{div}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n0&amp;b=0,\\\\\n\\max\\{q\\in\\mathbb N:q\\le a\\land\\mathrm{mul}(b,q)\\le a\\}&amp;b&gt;0,\n\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\mathrm{rem}(a,b)\\coloneqq a\\dotminus\\mathrm{mul}(b,\\mathrm{div}(a,b)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{div}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n0&amp;b=0,\\\\\n\\max\\{q\\in\\mathbb N:q\\le a\\land\\mathrm{mul}(b,q)\\le a\\}&amp;b&gt;0,\n\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\mathrm{rem}(a,b)\\coloneqq a\\dotminus\\mathrm{mul}(b,\\mathrm{div}(a,b)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b&gt;0\\to[a=b\\,\\mathrm{div}(a,b)+\\mathrm{rem}(a,b)\\land\\mathrm{rem}(a,b)&lt;b],\\qquad\\mathrm{rem}(a,0)=a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b&gt;0\\to[a=b\\,\\mathrm{div}(a,b)+\\mathrm{rem}(a,b)\\land\\mathrm{rem}(a,b)&lt;b],\\qquad\\mathrm{rem}(a,0)=a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>零除数分支只为给出全函数。原 β 调用的除数为正数，不受这一补全分支影响。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-addition-function","status":"resolved","id":"7419fb5f5a6ad5df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-multiplication-function","status":"resolved","id":"c6df01b45cb8cc59","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-multiplication-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-addition-function","status":"resolved","id":"7419fb5f5a6ad5df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-addition-function]]、[[57-df-multiplication-function]]、[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。$\\dotminus$ 是下式定义的截断减法。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-multiplication-function","status":"resolved","id":"c6df01b45cb8cc59","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-addition-function]]、[[57-df-multiplication-function]]、[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。$\\dotminus$ 是下式定义的截断减法。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[57-df-addition-function]]、[[57-df-multiplication-function]]、[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。$\\dotminus$ 是下式定义的截断减法。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{PR}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\dotminus","display":false},{"tex":"a\\dotminus c\\coloneqq\\max\\{a-c,0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{div}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n0&b=0,\\\\\n\\max\\{q\\in\\mathbb N:q\\le a\\land\\mathrm{mul}(b,q)\\le a\\}&b>0,\n\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\mathrm{rem}(a,b)\\coloneqq a\\dotminus\\mathrm{mul}(b,\\mathrm{div}(a,b)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.","display":true},{"tex":"b>0\\to[a=b\\,\\mathrm{div}(a,b)+\\mathrm{rem}(a,b)\\land\\mathrm{rem}(a,b)<b],\\qquad\\mathrm{rem}(a,0)=a.","display":true}],"bytes":1180,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6b94974722658c7","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$a,i\\in\\mathbb N$，$s\\in\\mathbb N$ 是整个调用环境中的固定参数；$\\beta:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 为下式定义的函数，公开接口仍只有 $a,i$ 两个参数。$\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem},\\mathrm{fact},\\pi_i^n$ 分别取 [[57-df-addition-function]]、[[57-df-multiplication-function]]、[[57-df-divrem-function]]、[[57-df-factorial-function]]、[[57-df-projection-function]]；$\\mathrm{PR}$、复合及原始递归取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]、[[57-df-composition-operator]]、[[57-df-primrec-operator]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notati